      "verses": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "ml": "ദൈവമേ കാത്തുകൊൾകങ്ങു\nകൈവിടാതിങ്ങു ഞങ്ങളെ\nനാവികൻ നീ ഭവാബ്ധിക്കോ-\nരാവിവൻതോണി നിൻപദം",
          "translit": "daivamē kāttukoḷkaṅṅu\nkaiviṭātiṅṅu ñaṅṅaḷe\nnāvikan nī bhavābdhikkō-\nrāvivan tōṇi niṉpadaṁ",
          "en": "God, protect us, and do not let go of us here. You are the helmsman, and your feet are the great steam-boat across the ocean of becoming."
        },
